{"seq":4,"slug":"binary-optimization","title":"二进制优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/binary-optimization","wordCount":938,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"二进制优化\">二进制优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>二进制优化</strong>（Binary Optimization）指在保证功能正确的前提下缩减可执行文件体积。更小的体积意味着更快的下载、更低的存储占用，以及在受限环境中的更好体验。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>典型收益</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cargo.toml 配置</td>\n<td>30-60%</td>\n<td>编译变慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>strip 符号表</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>丢失符号，调试变难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LTO</td>\n<td>取决于工程</td>\n<td>编译显著变慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPX 压缩</td>\n<td>再 50-70%</td>\n<td>启动略慢，可能误报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积分析</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>定位优化点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>优化的核心权衡是<strong>编译时间 / 调试便利</strong>与<strong>运行体积</strong>之间的取舍，且应先用分析工具定位体积来源，而非盲目堆配置。本文按此顺序展开。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么关注体积\">为什么关注体积</h2><p>Rust 编译的<strong>二进制体积</strong>（Binary Size）可能超出预期——一个简单的 Hello World 在默认 release 配置下也有几百 KB。对于 CLI 工具来说，更小的体积意味着更快的下载、更低的存储占用，以及在带宽受限环境中的更好体验。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化阶段</th>\n<th>典型效果</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cargo.toml 配置</td>\n<td>减少 30-60%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>strip 符号表</td>\n<td>减少 20-40%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPX 压缩</td>\n<td>再减少 50-70%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码级优化</td>\n<td>因项目而异</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-toml-优化配置\">Cargo.toml 优化配置</h2><p>在 <code>[profile.release]</code> 中配置优化选项是最简单有效的体积缩减方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[profile.release]&#10;opt-level = &quot;z&quot;       # 优化体积（&quot;s&quot; 也可以）&#10;lto = true            # 启用链接时优化&#10;codegen-units = 1     # 单代码生成单元，更好的优化&#10;panic = &quot;abort&quot;       # abort 替代 unwind，减少异常处理代码&#10;strip = true          # 移除符号表和调试信息\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opt-level = \"z\"       # 优化体积（\"s\" 也可以）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lto = true            # 启用链接时优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>codegen-units = 1     # 单代码生成单元，更好的优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>panic = \"abort\"       # abort 替代 unwind，减少异常处理代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>strip = true          # 移除符号表和调试信息</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>opt-level</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;z&quot;</code></td>\n<td>最小体积优化</td>\n<td>可能牺牲少量性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>opt-level</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;s&quot;</code></td>\n<td>体积优化</td>\n<td>平衡体积和性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>opt-level</code></td>\n<td><code>3</code></td>\n<td>最大性能优化</td>\n<td>体积可能增大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lto</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>跨 crate 优化</td>\n<td>编译时间增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lto</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;thin&quot;</code></td>\n<td>部分跨 crate 优化</td>\n<td>编译快，效果中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>codegen-units</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n<td>单线程代码生成</td>\n<td>编译慢，优化好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>panic</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;abort&quot;</code></td>\n<td>移除 unwind 代码</td>\n<td>无法 catch panic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>strip</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>移除所有符号</td>\n<td>无法调试 release</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[默认 release] --&gt;|opt-level=z| B[体积优化]&#10;    B --&gt;|lto=true| C[链接时优化]&#10;    C --&gt;|codegen-units=1| D[单线程生成]&#10;    D --&gt;|strip=true| E[移除符号]&#10;    E --&gt;|panic=abort| F[最终二进制]\">graph LR\n    A[默认 release] --&gt;|opt-level=z| B[体积优化]\n    B --&gt;|lto=true| C[链接时优化]\n    C --&gt;|codegen-units=1| D[单线程生成]\n    D --&gt;|strip=true| E[移除符号]\n    E --&gt;|panic=abort| F[最终二进制]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"strip-详解\">Strip 详解</h2><p><strong>strip</strong> 移除二进制文件中的符号表和调试信息，这是最简单的体积优化手段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml 中配置 (推荐)&#10;# strip = true&#10;&#10;# 手动 strip&#10;strip target/release/mytool&#10;&#10;# macOS 上使用&#10;strip -x target/release/mytool&#10;&#10;# 查看符号信息&#10;nm target/release/mytool | head -20&#10;&#10;# 查看段信息&#10;size target/release/mytool\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Cargo.toml 中配置 (推荐)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># strip = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 手动 strip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/release/mytool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># macOS 上使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strip</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/release/mytool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看符号信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/release/mytool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看段信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">size</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/release/mytool</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>strip 方式</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cargo 内置</td>\n<td><code>strip = true</code></td>\n<td>编译时自动 strip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命令行 strip</td>\n<td><code>strip binary</code></td>\n<td>移除所有符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留部分</td>\n<td><code>strip -x binary</code></td>\n<td>保留全局符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>debuginfo 分离</td>\n<td><code>objcopy --only-keep-debug</code></td>\n<td>符号存入独立文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"lto-链接时优化\">LTO 链接时优化</h2><p><strong>LTO</strong>（Link-Time Optimization）在链接阶段跨 crate 边界优化代码，能够消除未使用的函数和内联跨 crate 调用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# 完整 LTO：最佳优化，编译最慢&#10;[profile.release]&#10;lto = true&#10;&#10;# Thin LTO：较好优化，编译较快&#10;[profile.release]&#10;lto = &quot;thin&quot;&#10;&#10;# 无 LTO：最快编译，最大体积&#10;[profile.release]&#10;lto = false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 完整 LTO：最佳优化，编译最慢</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lto = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Thin LTO：较好优化，编译较快</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lto = \"thin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 无 LTO：最快编译，最大体积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lto = false</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let sizes = vec![&#10;        (&quot;无优化 (debug)&quot;, &quot;15.2 MB&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;默认 release&quot;, &quot;4.8 MB&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;opt-level=z&quot;, &quot;3.2 MB&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;+ lto=true&quot;, &quot;2.1 MB&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;+ codegen-units=1&quot;, &quot;1.9 MB&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;+ strip=true&quot;, &quot;1.2 MB&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;+ panic=abort&quot;, &quot;1.1 MB&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;+ UPX 压缩&quot;, &quot;0.4 MB&quot;),&#10;    ];&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;{:&lt;25} {:&gt;10}&quot;, &quot;配置&quot;, &quot;体积&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, &quot;-&quot;.repeat(37));&#10;    for (config, size) in &amp;sizes {&#10;        println!(&quot;{:&lt;25} {:&gt;10}&quot;, config, size);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let sizes = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"无优化 (debug)\", \"15.2 MB\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"默认 release\", \"4.8 MB\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"opt-level=z\", \"3.2 MB\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"+ lto=true\", \"2.1 MB\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"+ codegen-units=1\", \"1.9 MB\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"+ strip=true\", \"1.2 MB\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"+ panic=abort\", \"1.1 MB\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"+ UPX 压缩\", \"0.4 MB\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{:&#x3C;25} {:>10}\", \"配置\", \"体积\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", \"-\".repeat(37));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (config, size) in &#x26;sizes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{:&#x3C;25} {:>10}\", config, size);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"upx-压缩\">UPX 压缩</h2><p><strong>UPX</strong>（Ultimate Packer for eXecutables）是可执行文件压缩工具，能在运行时自解压。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 UPX&#10;brew install upx       # macOS&#10;apt install upx-ucl    # Ubuntu&#10;&#10;# 压缩二进制&#10;upx --best target/release/mytool&#10;&#10;# 查看压缩信息&#10;upx -l target/release/mytool&#10;&#10;# 解压（恢复原始）&#10;upx -d target/release/mytool\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 UPX</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # macOS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upx-ucl</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Ubuntu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 压缩二进制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">upx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --best</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/release/mytool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看压缩信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">upx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/release/mytool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 解压（恢复原始）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">upx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/release/mytool</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>UPX 选项</th>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n<th>启动开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--fast</code></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>对启动敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--best</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>少量增加</td>\n<td>通用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--ultra-brute</code></td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>明显增加</td>\n<td>极限压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--lzma</code></td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>较多增加</td>\n<td>下载分发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> UPX 会略微增加启动时间（通常 10-50ms），对于 CLI 工具通常可以接受。但在 macOS 上 UPX 可能与代码签名冲突，需要注意。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"体积分析\">体积分析</h2><p>了解体积的来源是优化的前提。<strong>cargo-bloat</strong> 和 <strong>cargo-llvm-lines</strong> 帮助分析二进制中各部分的体积占比。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装分析工具&#10;cargo install cargo-bloat&#10;cargo install cargo-llvm-lines&#10;&#10;# 查看最大的函数&#10;cargo bloat --release -n 20&#10;&#10;# 查看最大的 crate&#10;cargo bloat --release --crates&#10;&#10;# 查看生成的 LLVM IR 行数&#10;cargo llvm-lines --release | head -30\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装分析工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cargo-bloat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cargo-llvm-lines</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看最大的函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bloat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看最大的 crate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bloat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --crates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看生成的 LLVM IR 行数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> llvm-lines</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -30</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型的体积分布分析：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>典型占比</th>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准库</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td><code>panic=abort</code> 减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方 crate</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n<td>选择轻量替代品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用代码</td>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n<td>减少泛型实例化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试信息</td>\n<td>10-30%</td>\n<td>strip 移除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常处理</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td><code>panic=abort</code> 移除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;常用 crate 的体积影响:&quot;);&#10;    println!();&#10;    let crates = vec![&#10;        (&quot;clap (derive)&quot;, &quot;~400 KB&quot;, &quot;参数解析&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;reqwest&quot;, &quot;~1.5 MB&quot;, &quot;HTTP 客户端&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;tokio (full)&quot;, &quot;~800 KB&quot;, &quot;异步运行时&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;serde + serde_json&quot;, &quot;~300 KB&quot;, &quot;序列化&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;indicatif&quot;, &quot;~100 KB&quot;, &quot;进度条&quot;),&#10;        (&quot;anyhow&quot;, &quot;~20 KB&quot;, &quot;错误处理&quot;),&#10;    ];&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;{:&lt;25} {:&gt;12} {}&quot;, &quot;Crate&quot;, &quot;增加体积&quot;, &quot;功能&quot;);&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, &quot;-&quot;.repeat(55));&#10;    for (name, size, desc) in &amp;crates {&#10;        println!(&quot;{:&lt;25} {:&gt;12} {}&quot;, name, size, desc);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"常用 crate 的体积影响:\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let crates = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"clap (derive)\", \"~400 KB\", \"参数解析\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"reqwest\", \"~1.5 MB\", \"HTTP 客户端\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"tokio (full)\", \"~800 KB\", \"异步运行时\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"serde + serde_json\", \"~300 KB\", \"序列化\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"indicatif\", \"~100 KB\", \"进度条\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (\"anyhow\", \"~20 KB\", \"错误处理\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{:&#x3C;25} {:>12} {}\", \"Crate\", \"增加体积\", \"功能\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", \"-\".repeat(55));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (name, size, desc) in &#x26;crates {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{:&#x3C;25} {:>12} {}\", name, size, desc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>features</code> 精确控制依赖的功能集。例如 <code>tokio</code> 默认启用所有特性，但 CLI 工具通常只需要 <code>rt</code>、<code>macros</code> 和 <code>signal</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((二进制优化))&#10;    Cargo 配置&#10;      opt-level z/s&#10;      lto true/thin&#10;      codegen-units 1&#10;      panic abort&#10;      strip true&#10;    Strip&#10;      移除符号表&#10;      debuginfo 分离&#10;    UPX&#10;      可执行压缩&#10;      启动时间权衡&#10;    体积分析&#10;      cargo-bloat&#10;      cargo-llvm-lines&#10;      crate 体积审计&#10;    依赖优化&#10;      精选 features&#10;      轻量替代品\">mindmap\n  root((二进制优化))\n    Cargo 配置\n      opt-level z/s\n      lto true/thin\n      codegen-units 1\n      panic abort\n      strip true\n    Strip\n      移除符号表\n      debuginfo 分离\n    UPX\n      可执行压缩\n      启动时间权衡\n    体积分析\n      cargo-bloat\n      cargo-llvm-lines\n      crate 体积审计\n    依赖优化\n      精选 features\n      轻量替代品</pre><ul>\n<li>Cargo.toml 的 release profile 配置是最简单有效的优化手段，可减少 50% 以上体积</li>\n<li><code>strip = true</code> 移除符号表，<code>panic = &quot;abort&quot;</code> 移除异常处理代码，两者叠加效果显著</li>\n<li>LTO 实现跨 crate 优化，<code>codegen-units = 1</code> 允许编译器进行更全局的优化</li>\n<li>UPX 压缩可进一步减少 50-70% 体积，但会略微增加启动时间</li>\n<li>cargo-bloat 帮助识别体积大户，精确控制依赖 features 避免引入不必要的代码</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"二进制优化","id":"二进制优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么关注体积","id":"为什么关注体积"},{"level":2,"text":"Cargo.toml 优化配置","id":"cargo-toml-优化配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Strip 详解","id":"strip-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"LTO 链接时优化","id":"lto-链接时优化"},{"level":2,"text":"UPX 压缩","id":"upx-压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"体积分析","id":"体积分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交叉编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/cross-compilation"},"next":{"title":"Node CLI 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/nodejs-cli/node-cli-architecture"}}